---
description: Flow contract rules
alwaysApply: true
---

`docs/reference/Flow_contract.pdf` is canonical for generated Flow payloads.

Rules:
- ProcessModelEvent goes only to model topic.
- ProcessInstanceEvent goes only to instance topic.
- Required does not imply non-null.
- Required nullable property must remain present as JSON null.
- variables is arbitrary nested JSON object.
- extIds is object or null.
- Separate ProcessState and NodeState enums.
- Do not invent Flow contract field names.
- Serialize `instancesSuspended`, not typo `instansesSuspended`.
- Common headers:
  ce_type
  ce_source
  ce_specversion
  ce_time
  ce_id
- Do not hardcode unknown production values of ce_type/source/specversion.
